---
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { owner } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<div class="bio" data-testid="bio">
		<p>
			I'm a Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) with 4.5+ years building Playwright + TypeScript automation
			frameworks.
		</p>
		<p>
			At Aumni Techworks, I automate web-app and API testing with Playwright, TypeScript and the Playwright-Cucumber
			(BDD) framework. Before that, at Cognizant, I designed and scaled automation frameworks across legacy migration,
			payment and insurance platforms.
		</p>
		<p>
			Alongside test automation, I'm building backend skills with Java and Spring Boot through low-level and system
			design practice: a JWT-based auth service, a Stripe-integrated payment service and a Splitwise-style expense
			splitter.
		</p>
		<p>
			I came into tech from non-technical roles in customer service and hospitality. I'm completing Scaler's Full
			Stack Development program, and I hold an AWS Solutions Architect Associate certification.
		</p>
	</div>
	<ul class="about-links">
		<li><a class="button button-primary" href={owner.resume} download>Download résumé</a></li>
		<li><ExternalLink href={owner.links.github}>GitHub</ExternalLink></li>
		<li><ExternalLink href={owner.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</ExternalLink></li>
	</ul>
</BaseLayout>
